===Go to the Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery and speak with Dahao{{subst:void|<!--202030502-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery|update|The Official Dahao saw you help the Healer Lady out of trouble at the Exalting Sanctum and mentioned that there is something he needs your help with. It's not just babysitting children, is it?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Dahao)
;(First interaction)
::'''Dahao:''' I always feel like we're missing something here at the Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery, but I can never remember what. You've come at just the right time &mdash; help me rule out some possibilities. Say, tell me, what do you think our office is missing?
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Promo materials showcasing the work of the Realm-Keeping Commission.
:::'''Dahao:''' Not that...
:::'''Dahao:''' I raised this with Jingyan before, whether we should be better at promoting how good the Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery is at what it does. But she gave me a list of all the things we've done recently, and there isn't really anything to be proud of.
:::'''Dahao:''' Once we crack a major case that even the Ten-Lords Commission can't solve, then I'll let the whole Exalting Sanctum know about how great the Realm-Keeping Commission is... Until then, we'll keep things on the down-low.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Small ornaments that make this place feel alive.
:::'''Dahao:''' Make the place feel alive... Actually, I've thought about that.
:::'''Dahao:''' I'm a big fan of alcoholic nectar and once stashed two bottles of Nectar of Willow Woods at the Chancery, but Officer Jingyan threw them out. She said this is the workplace and it would be undignified if anyone found out.
:::'''Dahao:''' I also like pretty foxian actresses, so I've put up a couple of their pictures on my desk to perk up my spirits. But Officer Jingyan confiscated those too. She said this is the workplace and those images are indecent.
:::'''Dahao:''' *sigh* The only way the Realm-Keeping Commission feels alive is through all the courier parcels on the ground.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} A Realm-Keeping Commission Officer who is actually productive at work.
:::'''Dahao:''' {{MC|ж=Young lady|м=Young man}}, that remark is uncalled for. At least Officer Jingyan is doing her work. As long as Officer Jingyan is here, then the Realm-Keeping Commission lives up to its name.
:::'''Dahao:''' That Songyan kid may be lazy, but he's smart. I have high hopes for his future.
:::'''Dahao:''' Naturally, if anything actually happens to Exalting Sanctum, you'll find me to be an extremely reliable officer.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is now really the time to be thinking about that?
:::'''Dahao:''' Yeah, I can't figure it out even if I rack my brain. I think I'll play a few rounds of Celestial Jade after work and think it through then.
:::'''Dahao:''' Alright, let's get down to business. {{MC|ж=Young lady|м=Young man}}, what do you want?
;(Subsequent interactions)
::'''Dahao:''' Things would be a lot easier around here if the General Affairs Office stopped holding so many pointless meetings... So, {{MC|ж=young lady|м=young man}}, how can I help you today?
;(If {{cx}}<!--performance 202010301 has not been seen-->)
:{{Диалог|undefined}} When I was dealing with the mara-struck, I found this...
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} It's about the Dragon Lady?
::'''Dahao:''' Yes, you have extraordinary skills, and you earned her trust when you rescued her...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Earned her trust? When did that happen?
:::'''Dahao:''' You rescued her from the mara-struck... I'd say she's forever in your debt.
:::'''Dahao:''' If you go see her, I'm sure she won't run away.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why do people here keep making me run errands?
:::'''Dahao:''' If I had more people, I wouldn't have to ask for external help. But as things stand...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Okay, I'll do it!
:::'''Dahao:''' Hah, that was fast! Thanks for your help.
::'''Dahao:''' Here's the situation: Lady Bailu, the Vidyadhara Dragon Lady, has escaped from the Alchemy Commission again. I say "again" because the Realm-Keeping Commission has seen more than a few of her bad-tempered escapes.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Vidyadhara?
:::'''Dahao:''' This must be your first time on the Xianzhou... It's a long story. The Vidyadhara is one of the three races that established the Xianzhou Alliance.
:::'''Dahao:''' Their bloodline is different from us Xianzhou natives. The Vidyadhara are born with great vitality, the gift of the Permanence, as they say.
:::'''Dahao:''' That's all you need to know. The rest is irrelevant to what's happening today.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What does a Dragon Lady do exactly?
:::'''Dahao:''' A Dragon Lady... isn't an official position. People address her that way out of love.
:::'''Dahao:''' The Vidyadhara "high elder," on the other hand, is a position similar to a chief &mdash; it's been passed down from generation to generation. But only the Vidyadhara that possess draconic features and inherit the dragon heart can be successors.
:::'''Dahao:''' And Miss Bailu is the Vidyadhara's future high elder on the Luofu.
:::'''Dahao:''' The rumor has always been that she can heal the wounded merely by touching them and shedding tears. She also studied medicine in the Alchemy Commission. That's why her other title is "Healer Lady."
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} She escaped? Was she imprisoned?
:::'''Dahao:''' Not imprisoned exactly... Vidyadhara customs are somewhat different from Xianzhou native customs. Miss Bailu has incredible talents and is next in line to rule over the Vidyadhara &mdash; it's normal that her people would want to keep a close eye on her.
:::'''Dahao:''' However, she also has a somewhat free spirit... She always manages to find a way to escape her residence.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm listening.
:::'''Dahao:''' It used to be the duty of the Realm-Keeping Commission to go after her and take her back to the Alchemy Commission.
:::'''Dahao:''' But, this time is different. Because of the Stellaron crisis, we're constantly short of manpower. Besides, even if we catch the Dragon Lady, we can't take her back anytime soon.
:::'''Dahao:''' I don't know if you heard &mdash; someone locked down the delves connected to the Alchemy Commission.
:::'''Dahao:''' Now nobody can get in or out &mdash; it's completely cut off. Something very fishy is going on.
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} So how did the Dragon Lady get out?
::::'''Dahao:''' That's what I want to know. I guess she sneaked out before the delves were locked down. She might even know what happened in the Alchemy Commission...
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} But I saw doctors...
::::'''Dahao:''' Those doctors came from apothecaries in other delves. I've asked them, and they don't have the slightest clue what's going on.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Then... is there really anything I can do?
::::'''Dahao:''' I'd like you to help with two things. First, find the Dragon Lady and take care of her until the Alchemy Commission delves are reopened. Don't lose sight of her.
::::'''Dahao:''' The second thing might be a bit hard to understand... I want you to stop her from treating the mara-struck.
::::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Can't the Realm-Keeping Commission take care of her?
:::::'''Dahao:''' Like I said &mdash; we don't have enough people! The Dragon Lady is smart. If we try to keep her in the Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery, she'll sneak out the first chance she gets. Trust me, it's happened before...
:::::'''Dahao:''' Besides, it isn't a crime for her to run away from her residence. And even if it were, given her status, we couldn't exactly stick her in jail and throw away the key! You're the only person we can turn to.
::::;(Return to previous option selection)
::::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why stop her from treating the mara-struck?
:::::'''Dahao:''' Being stricken with mara isn't like catching a curable disease. All the Healer Lady can do is slow the process.
:::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's not a disease?
:::::'''Dahao:''' Take you short-life species as an example. Do you consider aging a disease?
:::::'''Dahao:''' Aging can be slowed, but it's still unavoidable &mdash; just like being stricken with mara for the people of the Xianzhou... Unfortunately, becoming mara-struck is more terrifying than death. It's an inevitable curse in the blood of Xianzhou natives.
::::;(Return to previous option selection)
::::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Then, what can be done for them?
:::::'''Dahao:''' The Xianzhou has long had other methods. When mara is about to strike, the spiritfarers and judges of the Ten-Lords Commission promptly take the afflicted away. It's not something the Alchemy Commission should be meddling in.
:::::'''Dahao:''' Mara is scary, but it won't cause any harm if you have it under control. We have the Realm-Keeping Commission and Cloud Knights here in Exalting Sanctum &mdash; more than enough to handle any eventuality.
:::::'''Dahao:''' However, the Dragon Lady's mara-suppression could lead to mara-struck falling under the Ten-Lords Commission's radar. If we let her carry on, we'll have mara-struck on every street corner &mdash; people will panic!
:::::'''Dahao:''' Seeing as we're already dealing with one crisis, we need to be extra vigilant when dealing with the mara-struck. This is not something that can be taken lightly.
::::;(Return to previous option selection)
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I see. Leave it to me.
:::::'''Dahao:''' You're the distinguished guest of General Jing Yuan and Diviner Fu Xuan. As such, you also have the full trust of the Realm-Keeping Commission.
:::::'''Dahao:''' Oh, one more thing... There's a lot of suspicion surrounding the Alchemy Commission these days. If you discover someone from the commission on the hunt for the Dragon Lady, watch your step.
:::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It'll be a piece of cake.
::::::'''Dahao:''' Great!
:::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Babysitting? No thanks, I'd rather watch paint dry.
::::::'''Dahao:''' There's no other way. The Realm-Keeping Commission will pay you handsomely for your help.
:::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I have a feeling this is more complicated than it sounds...
::::::'''Dahao:''' Bah, don't fret. Looking after children is a pain, but as the general's distinguished guest, I know you'll do great.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} (Report Todd)
::Dahao patiently listens to you recount the story, expressionless the whole time.
::'''Dahao:''' Tsk, there's always a Guild scout who reckons that the Alliance's taboos are just hypocritical lies and not for them...
::'''Dahao:''' "Immortality Theft" is one of the most grievous of felonies and is absolutely unpardonable. I'll report this to the Ten-Lords Commission. Thanks, (Trailblazer).
::'''Dahao:''' Mr. Todd's customs clearance docket and check-in details from the inn have been saved to the document office at the Realm-Keeping Commission. No matter how many more years his newfound youth affords him, he'll be spending the majority of it behind bars at The Shackling Prison.
:{{Диалог}} I've got a few things to ask.
::'''Dahao:''' I won't be able to answer if it's too difficult. You can ask Officer Jingyan instead.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What does an officer do every day?
:::'''Dahao:''' Officers are managers in the Chancery, responsible for coordinating all local internal and external affairs &mdash; that's the surface definition. Actually, the main job involves going to meetings at the Realm-Keeping Commission's General Affairs Office and spreading their ideas.
:::'''Dahao:''' Honestly, I'm not very good at these clerical jobs. I used to be the leader for a Cloud Knight squad that reported directly to General Jing Yuan. Are you surprised? I'm like a fish in water when it comes to weaponry. Not when it comes to office meetings.
:::'''Dahao:''' However, veteran soldiers are far more likely than everyday citizens to be stricken with mara &mdash; something to do with post-traumatic stress. Anyways, it's very dangerous.
:::'''Dahao:''' So they transferred me here to be an officer. There's no life-or-death situations here, but it ain't easy work. I don't know exactly what I'm doing, but I know that I'm busy.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Officer Jingyan seems very capable.
:::'''Dahao:''' She's the most capable girl I've ever met. No matter what the job is, she will get it done.
:::'''Dahao:''' She used to be my subordinate back when I was still in the Cloud Knights, and she came over with me when I was transferred to the Realm-Keeping Commission. I taught her everything I knew, but for some reason she chose to stick around...
:::'''Dahao:''' Sometimes I even wonder whether this work at the Realm-Keeping Commission is hindering her future career prospects. But I've never actually said it out loud, and she's become an indispensable part of the Chancery.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Officer Songyan doesn't seem very motivated?
:::'''Dahao:''' That little punk wasn't always this way. Apparently he used to be an elite at the General Affairs Office &mdash; but he became completely demotivated after some kind of setback, and was transferred to our jurisdiction.
:::'''Dahao:''' At any other workplace, he'd be cast aside for being so lazy, right? But I want to give him some more time. He's just not ready yet.
:::'''Dahao:''' We have no way of really understanding him, but at least we can give him "enough time," be it decades or centuries. That's one of the few great benefits of living in a long-life society.
:::'''Dahao:''' Of course, I don't think time alone is enough to solve every problem. If he doesn't make changes for himself, then the problems he's facing will never change either.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} That's enough chit-chat.
:::'''Dahao:''' Alright, it's time for me to watch the news anyway. See you later.
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} The disaster is over, are you guys still busy?
::'''Dahao:''' Thanks to you, we aren't as busy as before. However, as the Realm-Keeping Commission manages basically everything in both the sky and the world, we can never be idle.
::'''Dahao:''' Organizing post-disaster reconstruction, pursuing the Sanctus Medicus remnants, and arresting looters... Alas, there is plenty of work to be done despite the disaster being over...
::'''Dahao:''' The good thing is that Jingyan is very capable, and Songyan is... doing okay. Thanks to their help, I'm not overwhelmed by the workload.
::'''Dahao:''' I think I'll need a lot more help from you in the future... Don't turn me down when the time comes. Let me thank you in advance.
;(If {{Mission|Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead|showChapter=0}} has been completed)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} That's enough chit-chat.
::'''Dahao:''' Alright, it's time for me to watch the news anyway. See you later.
;(Unused &mdash; 140186_SubmitSucceed)
:Dahao carefully reads the letter you delivered. His expression reflects his disbelief as he reads it again.
::{{Black Screen|Dahao sweats profusely as he apologizes and bolts away. After a while, he returns with a girl.}}
::'''Dahao:''' I... I read the letter...
::'''Dahao:''' I'll be honest with you, I've got no idea how to handle this problem &mdash; it's beyond the Realm-Keeping Commission's jurisdiction. I contacted the Seat of Divine Foresight, which is overseen by the general.
::'''Dahao:''' ...Allow me to introduce Madam Qingzu, General Jing Yuan's chief counselor.
::'''Dahao:''' I think it'll be easier if she explains the letter to you.

;(Unused &mdash; TalkSentence_202160018)
:'''Dahao:''' Uh... What's this? Looks pretty ordinary to me.
::'''Dahao:''' C'mon now, (Trailblazer), this is a serious matter &mdash; there's no time for jokes.

;(Talk to Jingyan)
;(First interaction)
::'''Jingyan:''' One second.
::'''Jingyan:''' Alright. I'm Jingyan from the Realm-Keeping Commission, and I'm in charge of general affairs here. Is there anything that I can help you with?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What can you help me with?
:::'''Jingyan:''' ...I was just asking you that, but you asked me the same thing. Okay.
:::'''Jingyan:''' Household registrations, applications, and maintenance for local Xianzhou citizens. Handling of cases such as fighting, wounding with a weapon, theft, robbery. Processing census data, demographic statistics, resource allocation...
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I get it. Please stop this monotonous chanting.
::::'''Jingyan:''' Looks like you aren't really that interested in the work of Realm-Keeping Commission officers.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yes, you've all done a great job.
::::'''Jingyan:''' Ah, so you're here to inspect our work then? Thank you for taking the time to visit our humble Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery.
::::'''Jingyan:''' But I'm afraid it's currently during business hours, so please do not interrupt our everyday consultations.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've been cyber-scammed!
:::'''Jingyan:''' Cyber-scammed? We don't differentiate between scams happening online or offline here.
:::'''Jingyan:''' Please register your contact details, how the scammer contacted you, how you were scammed, and how much you were scammed out of? Go fill this out, and I'll verify your account for you.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Actually, I wasn't scammed at all.
::::'''Jingyan:''' Hmm. It's still currently during business hours, so please do not cause any trouble for our busy officers.
::::'''Jingyan:''' Based on my experience, you don't really look like a victim of scamming.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Th&mdash;There's no transaction record on the account.
::::'''Jingyan:''' This is a bit of a hassle. Not even the Realm-Keeping Commission can get back your "money that wasn't scammed."
::::'''Jingyan:''' Seems like you'll have to sort that part out on your own. Our hands are tied here at the Realm-Keeping Commission.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't think I have anything that's connected to general affairs.
::'''Jingyan:''' Excuse me, do you have anything else?
;(Subsequent interactions)
::'''Jingyan:''' Greetings. What can the Realm-Keeping Commission help you with today?
;(If )
:{{Диалог|?}} I've been scammed.
::'''Jingyan:''' Are you the victim? State your name, occupation, and amount in losses.
::Please recount for me your entire experience of getting scammed in the street.
::'''Jingyan:''' You must be the victim. This guy used the old "Family Treasure Sword" scam to trick Outworlders all the time. The victims are unfamiliar with Xianzhou history, and so are easily tricked.
::'''Jingyan:''' What then was the amount lost?
:;(If the player has greater than or equal to {{Предмет|Praise of High Morals|20|x=1}})
